# REA docs (`docs/rea/`)

Follow `docs/REA_GHIDRA.md`. Required files:

- `binary_pin.md` — path, SHA256, version
- `loader_entrypoints.md` — parse/alloc functions
- `struct_layouts.md` — field offsets/sizes
- `bitpack_rules.md` — shifts, masks, width
- `paging_model.md` — expert/layer paging

## Rules

- Uncertain fields: prefix with `HYPOTHESIS:`.
- Do not mark hypotheses as confirmed until runtime load or source cross-check.
- When changing a rule that code uses, update `polystrata`/`quant` constants in the same task and note the REA section in the code comment.
- No binary blobs or full model weights in this folder.
